## 🔀 Encrypted Branching with FHE.select

Since you can't use `if` statements on encrypted booleans, use `FHE.select`:

```solidity
// Instead of:
if (encryptedCondition) { result = a; } else { result = b; }

// Use:
result = FHE.select(encryptedCondition, a, b);
```

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[ebool condition] --> B{FHE.select}
    C[euint ifTrue] --> B
    D[euint ifFalse] --> B
    B --> E[euint result]
```

