## 🧪 Lab Challenge

**Goal:** Understand replay attack risks and mitigation.

### The Vulnerability:
```solidity
// ❌ Vulnerable: Same input can be used twice
function claim(input, proof) {
    balance += FHE.fromExternal(input, proof);
}
```

### The Fix:
```solidity
// ✅ Secure: State prevents replay
function claim(input, proof) {
    require(!hasClaimed[msg.sender]);
    balance += FHE.fromExternal(input, proof);
    hasClaimed[msg.sender] = true;
}
```
